	"description": {
		"ja": [
			"新作テレビアニメ『魔神創造伝ワタル』制作決定！",
			"主人公「星部ワタル」のイトコ「天部カケル」の魔神「麒麟丸」がラインアップ！",
			"• 部位ごとにパーツを分けられるシリーズ共通フレームを採用。他の魔神と組み合わせて遊ぼう！",
			"• パチパチと手で外せるタッチゲート仕様。接着剤無しで組み立てられる！",
			"• チャクラム型の武器は背面に取り付け可能。",
			"• 武器や頭部などはメタリックなゴールド成形色で再現。"
		],
		"en": [
			"Production of the new TV anime “Mashin Souzouden Wataru” has been decided!",
			"The lineup includes the demon \"Kirinmaru\" of the main character \"Wataru Hoshibe\"'s cousin \"Kakeru Amabe\"!",
			"• Adopts a common frame across the series that allows parts to be separated by area. Let's play in combination with other genies!",
			"• Touch gate design that can be removed by hand. Can be assembled without adhesive!",
			"• Chakram-type weapons can be attached to the back.",
			"• Weapons and heads are reproduced in metallic gold molding color."
		]
